istry of culture, sector of digital research infrastructure development in the areas of arts and culture.", "short_description": "MANASIJA MONASTERY VR\nIs the result of the project \u201cPlatform for 3D digitization of immovable cultural treasure of Serbia\u201d that was realized by the University of Ni\u0161, Faculty of Electronic Engineering, with the support of the Ministry of culture of the Republic of Serbia"}]}, "developer_name": "University of Ni\u0161, Faculty of Electronic Engineering", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.srbija3d.rs/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Srbija3D", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.srbija3d.rs/EN/index.html", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "sr"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "913302739794104"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1604927243356992"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1604927243356992"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1679345940, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1604927243356992"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "6344988558845101", "version": "0.1"}, "id": "1408297750000427", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAp